{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new card based action adventure rpg set in the world of Caelum. Embark into a mysterious journey full of secrets and collect powerful cards to solve the riddles of this epic land and battle with other collectors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/b78bc7fe837ba03227beb9ec37088c3b.poster.avif?t=1744392942\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/b78bc7fe837ba03227beb9ec37088c3b.webm?t=1744392942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/b78bc7fe837ba03227beb9ec37088c3b.mp4?t=1744392942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A Nonlinear world experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that expands into multiple directions where you are free to make choices and decide your own path as a collector and adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/1bcd6ee7b1338aa30e6f6a1b125f4b56.poster.avif?t=1744392942\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/1bcd6ee7b1338aa30e6f6a1b125f4b56.webm?t=1744392942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/1bcd6ee7b1338aa30e6f6a1b125f4b56.mp4?t=1744392942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A riddle-full world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each corner may hide an enemy, a puzzle or a secret. Traverse with caution! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/33a1b537bf43781d022f44625dd82ac7.poster.avif?t=1744392942\" width=616 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/33a1b537bf43781d022f44625dd82ac7.webm?t=1744392942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148130/extras/33a1b537bf43781d022f44625dd82ac7.mp4?t=1744392942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cards are your weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the elements of the cards in the open world to take advantage of situations or make a powerful quick hand to take any collector out of your way!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Silencer of The Waste Land ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3148130/4c3425e2608e158e3860eb82048facac83c287b6.jpg"},{"name":"Eraser of the Pencillator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3148130/1143738d5bab124f3330782c8b329465f1447449.jpg"},{"name":"Frostbite Choreographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3148130/50c2ea6ba4ea1c739cb2a24156d583cf7b8fa47b.jpg"},{"name":"Steady Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3148130/6d003065894fcce799c2ee2b11b0dcde5cd77ef7.jpg"},{"name":"Vanquisher of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3148130/44bb515c1d0eee235a3284b2a94288afe7c2f92d.jpg"},{"name":"Extinguisher of The Toxins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima